╭── Pipeline ──────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ diamond  source: embedded default                        │
│                                                          │
│ Graph                                                    │
│    code_writer                                           │
│    lint  command                                         │
│      <- code_writer                                      │
│    static_analyzer                                       │
│      <- code_writer                                      │
│    test_runner                                           │
│      <- lint, static_analyzer                            │
│                                                          │
│ Command nodes                                            │
│   command node lint: go vet ./...                        │
│   1 command node runs shell commands when this topology  │
│   is active                                              │
│                                                          │
│ hint: change it with /pipeline use <name>; this view is  │
│ read-only                                                │
│ hint: Ctrl+G shows each node's model, budget, and last   │
│ result                                                   │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
